OL,3,GNEWSAMan cleared of assaults after fall
OL,4,Afrom football stand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who fell from the upper tier of a
OL,7,Fgrandstand during a football match on
OL,8,Fto fans below has been found not guilty
OL,9,Fof assault.
OL,11,FMaidstone United supporter John Ryan
OL,12,Ffell on to Joanne Peters and her
OL,13,Fpartner Aaron Rose at Ipswich Town's
OL,14,FPortman Road ground during an FA Cup
OL,15,Fclash in January 2024.
OL,17,FRyan, 62, of Railway Street, Chatham,
OL,18,FKent, denied one count of assault by
OL,19,Fbeating and one count of actual bodily
OL,20,Fharm and told Ipswich Crown Court he
OL,21,Fhad been unable to stop himself during
OL,22,Fgoal celebrations.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
